      {
        "type": "Module",
        "name": "preamp_ne5532",
        "description": "NE5532 dual low-noise operational amplifier configured as the initial preamplifier stage. Powered by the global VIN_9V single supply (VCC_P to VIN_9V, VCC_N to GND). Because of the single-supply architecture, a passive resistor divider is required to generate a virtual ground (VCC/2) bias point for the non-inverting input. The input signal (AUDIO_IN) is AC-coupled into the stage. The feedback network sets the preliminary voltage gain. The amplified output (AUDIO_MID) is routed to the final power amplifier stage.",
        "id": "preamp_ne5532"
      },
